# ========================================
# 🎯 OUTLOOK SETUP (5 MINUTES)
# ========================================
# 
# Outlook is much easier than Gmail for SMTP
# 
# SETUP STEPS:
# 1. Go to: https://outlook.com
# 2. Create new account (e.g., dxzmanager2024@outlook.com)
# 3. Update EMAIL_FROM and EMAIL_USER above
# 4. Update EMAIL_PASS with your Outlook password
# 5. Test: cd backend && node test-email.js
# 
# BENEFITS:
# ✅ No 2FA required
# ✅ No app passwords needed
# ✅ Real email delivery
# ✅ Works immediately
# 
# ALTERNATIVE: Use Mailtrap for development (always works)